    "body": "Animations should never compromise usability, screen-reader comprehension, or vestibular comfort:\n\n- **`prefers-reduced-motion` Support**: Components using `motion/react` subscribe to `useReducedMotion()`, and CSS/SVG/Canvas components include `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` rules and `matchMedia` listeners that disable continuous keyframe loops or instant-settle transitions.\n- **Screen-Reader Integrity**: Split-text components (`KineticType`, `GlyphCascade`, `AuroraHeadline`) expose the full sentence via `aria-label` or `.srOnly` while marking animated glyph tokens `aria-hidden=\"true\"`. `InfiniteMarquee` marks duplicated tracks `aria-hidden=\"true\"`.\n- **Keyboard & Touch Fallbacks**: `MagneticDock` supports `ArrowLeft`/`ArrowRight` focus cycling, `MorphingCommandPalette` supports `ArrowUp`/`ArrowDown`/`Enter`/`Escape`, and `MagneticButton`/`ParallaxDepthScene` ignore pointer displacement on touch devices (`pointerType === 'touch'`).",
    "code": "@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .travelingBeam,\n  .ribbonLayer,\n  .blob,\n  .track {\n    animation: none !important;\n  }\n}"
