    "body": "MotionFoundry enforces strict performance budgets across all 48 components:\n\n1. **Compositor-Only Keyframes**: Continuous animations animate `transform`, `opacity`, `clip-path`, or `background-position` rather than layout-thrashing properties.\n2. **Zero React State Re-Renders on Pointer Move**: `VelocityButton` and `LiquidGlassCard` update CSS variables (`el.style.setProperty`) directly without calling `setState` on every mousemove frame.\n3. **Deterministic Listener & RAF Cleanup**: `ConstellationCard` and `OrbitingParticles` cap particle counts and cancel `requestAnimationFrame` and `resize` listeners on unmount.",
